---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ISO 22000 Certification Appeals Process | Eurocert"
  description="Eurocert Inspection Services \u2014 certification, inspection, CE marking, ISO standards, food safety, social audits, sustainability and training across India and global operations."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/iso-22000/appeals/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[45vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367673/eurocert/F5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 22000"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">ISO 22000 — Process Document</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Process for Handling <span class="text-eurogold-400">Appeals</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Appeals against the decision of the EISPL can be addressed below</p></div></section><section class="bg-[#f8fafc] border-b border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] heading-font uppercase tracking-widest"><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/">Home</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000">ISO 22000</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><span class="text-euro-600 font-bold">Handling Appeals</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Appeals Process</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Processing of <span class="text-euro-600">Appeals</span></h2></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200"><div class="bg-[#030a16] px-8 py-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Appeal <span class="text-eurogold-400">Procedure</span></h3></div></div><div class="p-6 space-y-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><div class="pt-1"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold block mb-1">1st Line of Resolution</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">If the complainants disagree with decision or unsatisfied with the resolution of their grievance, they are entitled to appeal within 14 days of intimation of outcome of complaint investigation process.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The appeal can be made through e-mail.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Every appeal is required to be investigated and intimated to the appellant within 30 calendar days.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">4</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">An interim progress report is required to be sent to the appellant, if investigation take more than 30 days.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">5</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Director shall first try to resolve the matter, as 1st line of resolution.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">6</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The appellant shall be apprised about investigation is being taken up on their appeal.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-euro-600"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">7</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The outcome of the investigation and decision shall be informed to the appellant by on conclusion of investigation.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">8</span></div><div class="pt-1"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] text-amber-600 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold block mb-1">2nd Line of Resolution — Appeals Committee</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">If the outcome of this first line resolution (or review), still be unacceptable to the appellant, they have recourse to the appeals for 2nd line of resolution.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">9</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">When the appellant files for re-appeal, the Director shall refer the matter to Appeals Committee.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">10</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The appellant is informed about composition of the appeal committee immediately.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">11</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The appellant can have the right to object inclusion of any member including chairperson in the constituted committee. Such objections shall be communicated within three days to the EISPL.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">12</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">In event of objection from the appellant on inclusion of any member including chairperson in the constituted committee, a new committee is formed immediately.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">13</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The appeal committee shall meet immediately after issue of notification of the constitution.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">14</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The committee shall inform the appellant about venue, date and time of hearing and shall give reasonable time to the appellant to appear and respondent(s).</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">15</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The decision of the committee is based on the majority of the committee and the Chairman shall declare the decision within 3 days.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">16</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The decision is not binding on the appellant, and if not satisfied, can approach the Accreditation Body for review.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/30 hover:border-amber-200"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 bg-amber-500"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">17</span></div><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The EISPL is required to take corrective action as outlined in this procedure.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex-1 h-px bg-slate-200"></div><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/40"></div><div class="flex-1 h-px bg-slate-200"></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200"><div class="bg-[#030a16] px-8 py-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Rules for <span class="text-emerald-400">Appeal Cost</span></h3></div></div><div class="p-6 space-y-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">19</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The EISPL reserves the right to charge the Appellant, reasonable costs for this second line of independent appeals resolution through invoicing as defined in paragraphs.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">20</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Levy of charges to be notified in advance at the time of second line resolution and may be charged to the appellant ahead of any review commencing.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">21</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Approval of the Director to be obtained on the charges to be invoiced.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">22</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Under no circumstances, the EISPL or its employees or agents be liable for any losses or damages, except where costs arise as a result of the gross negligence or willful default of such persons.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-10 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-600 hover:text-euro-700 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-[9px]"></i> Back to ISO 22000</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
